WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.850
Number two is your mindset and your thinking.

00:00:02.850 --> 00:00:04.320
Think about your thought patterns and how

00:00:04.320 --> 00:00:07.120
you speak to yourself. Does your thinking help

00:00:07.120 --> 00:00:08.760
you move forward or do you hold yourself

00:00:08.760 --> 00:00:10.970
back? Do you regularly doubt yourself and

00:00:10.970 --> 00:00:12.040
second guess what's possible?

